+# Bank and telephone findings integrated into the investigation
+
+October26,2026. All **BP01-BP10** findings from the published bank/telephone
+tranche are now included, with their original identifiers, source links,
+qualifications and open targets. The exact source is AveLyra commit
+**bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2**; the fifteen-file published snapshot
+is retained unchanged under sources/published/. BP IDs count research entries,
+not independent witnesses or independent evidence of a conspiracy.
+
+[Published record](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md)
+and [source URLs/hashes](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/SOURCES.json).
+
+## What changes in the current investigation
+
+The first bank/carrier bundle **BR01**, linked to **S007/S013**, is now partially
+fulfilled: actual AT&T carrier-produced billing/call-detail pages, a subpoena
+return and FBI loading documentation are located. Earlier blanket statements
+that this bundle had not yet been independently integrated are historical.
+The preceding operational report/targets remain unchanged; this integration
+supplies a dated continuation rather than rewriting that record.
+
+The confirming sample concerns **June23,2000**, not the original carrier records
+for the **February4,2000 cellular sequence**. Original bank transaction images,
+teller evidence and the specifically cited repayment exhibits remain needed.
+The other four operational bundles retain their unresolved statuses in
+[targets-v2.json](targets-v2.json).
+
+## Integrated findings and their exact source locations
+
+The citations below refer to physical PDF pages and Bates identifiers in the
+published source catalog. Full conflicting wording is retained in the byte-exact
+[source record](sources/published/RECORD.md); the table states its limited bearing.
+
+| ID | Incorporated observation | Source location and current limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [BP01](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md#L7) | October14,2002 and November18,2002 FBI accounts differ about support for reimbursement. July21,2004 EC describes a $1,558 positive cash deposit/check and three transactions within seven minutes. | Joint Inquiry physical13 / printed422 n.1; FBI Part5 physical16, EO14040-002738; court p21. Congressional quotations and report statements do not supply the missing bank images/teller original. |
+| [BP02](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md#L34) | A draft financial table prints **-$1,558 Cash** and **-$1,558 cashier's check**, beside the separate positive-deposit description. | Part5 physical184, EO14040-002906; draft explicitly says sourcing incomplete. Preserve the signs and document status; do not repair a sign or infer two actual withdrawals. |
+| [BP03](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md#L54) | The 2003 interview's uncertain **$4,000-$8,000** cash estimate, a reported **$9,900** opening deposit, and differing attribution of the cash remain distinct. | Released2003 interview physical11, Bates000002669; averment section1637 / physical416; court p21. Amount, depositor, bank companion and ultimate cash source are different propositions. |
+| [BP04](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md#L76) | Five post-bank calls appear in an FBI analysis; an endpoint is described as **CBR** in that account and **cell phone** in the averment. | Part5 physical30 and35-37, EO14040-002752/002757-002759; averment section1639. The analysis is not a carrier return, and call content/speaker/subscriber attribution remain unknown. |
+| [BP05](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/bb9e9c5d6fd30ec3bb3fbc5359f388ef8c8c0db2/investigation/broader-evidence/bank-phone-records-2026-10-26/RECORD.md#L109) | **April19,2000** in the FBI report versus **April20,2000** in the averment remains unresolved. | Part5 physical37, EO14040-002759; averment section758 / physical197. No timezone or transcription explanation is adopted. |
