+      "verbatim_published_body": "\n**EO14040-002749, physical p.27** lists seven line-specific toll-record ranges:\n\n| FBI list item | Provider/line description | Tolls received cover |\n|---|---|---|\n|1|Pacific Bell home|Jan 17, 2000\u2013Jun 30, 2001|\n|2|Sprint cell, earlier number|Jan 9, 2000\u2013Jun 7, 2000|\n|3|Sprint cell, later number|Jun 8, 2000\u2013Apr 2, 2001|\n|4|Airtouch, c/o spouse|Nov 20, 1998\u2013Sep 20, 2000|\n|5|Pacific Bell Wireless, spouse subscriber|Sep 1, 2000\u2013Jul 28, 2001|\n|6|Pacific Bell mosque office|Jul 1, 1998\u2013Apr 22, 2001|\n|7|Pacific Bell, primarily Internet connection|Dec 15, 1999\u2013Jan 17, 2001|\n\nThe earlier Sprint service is separately described as beginning September 27, 1998.\nIts listed toll coverage begins much later. This does not establish that earlier\ncalls never happened, were destroyed, or were never collected elsewhere.\n[Inventory](https://vault.fbi.gov/9-11-attacks-investigation-and-related-materials/9-11-material-released-in-response-to-executive-order-14040/documents-responsive-to-executive-order-14040-2-c-part-5/at_download/file#page=27)\n\n**Open test:** provider return manifests, subpoena date/scope, all pages, import\nlogs and the relationship among changed numbers, office lines and subscriber/users.\nUnobserved intervals must not be counted as zero calls.\n",
