+      "verbatim_published_body": "\nThe **October 28, 2001 rental-manager interview**, transcribed October 29,\n**EO14040-003828\u2013003830; supplemental1 physical pp.161\u2013163**, describes the check as\n**$775 deposit + $8 insurance + $775 rent = $1,558**. The averment \u00a71638 instead\ndescribes rent, security deposit and an application fee. Keep both component labels.\nThe interview says Bayoumi brought the check **alone**; the averment \u00a71638 describes\nhim returning with both men. We have not obtained the cited later declaration and\ndeposition needed to compare those accounts directly.\n[Interview p.2](https://vault.fbi.gov/9-11-attacks-investigation-and-related-materials/9-11-material-released-in-response-to-executive-order-14040/documents-responsive-to-executive-order-14040-2-c-2-d-supplemental-release-1/at_download/file#page=162)\n\u00b7 [Averment \u00a71638](https://www.motleyrice.com/sites/default/files/documents/AT_HR/9-11/20240802%20Redacted%20public%20averment.pdf#page=416)\n\nThe interview also reports a roughly February 15 **$1,010** cashier's check and says\nits difference from the $775 rent was unexplained to the witness. The ledger,\nreceipt/check images, credits and allocation are needed; the difference is not\nevidence of concealed funding by itself.\n\nFinally, the witness thought the February deposit slip/accounting ledger had been\nreviewed and copied because it appeared re-stapled, with a copy in place of the\noriginal. The FD-302 says supporting payment documents/ledgers were attached and\noriginal copies would be maintained in the **1A section of the file**. This is an\nFBI record of a witness's observation/inference, not a forensic finding of tampering\nor identification of whoever handled the papers. The immediately following released\npage is a January 2002 telephone-record report, not an identified payment attachment.\nWe have not located those attachments; their absence from that position does not\nestablish that they were destroyed or omitted from every release.\n[Custody/attachment passage, p.163](https://vault.fbi.gov/9-11-attacks-investigation-and-related-materials/9-11-material-released-in-response-to-executive-order-14040/documents-responsive-to-executive-order-14040-2-c-2-d-supplemental-release-1/at_download/file#page=163)\n",
